> (e) Is there a way to say "rest until healed" or do you just have to
> keep hitting '.'?  I've found just holding it down is too dangerous ;)
You can rest for 5 turns with '5.' for 10 turns with '10.' and 2000 turns with
'2000.'. You can repeat the last action with ^A so this will rest for 30 turns:
10.
^A
^A

